    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "editorial--content",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>The UK unisex champions: Addiction & Mirage</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>No fragrance represents the modern unisex revolution better than <strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540). Its crystal-clear saffron, jasmine, and amberwood accord has become the signature scent of London, Manchester, and Edinburgh, worn equally by men and women who love magnetic sillage.</p><p>Similarly, <strong>Mirage</strong> pairs powdery Tuscan iris with smooth leather and cedarwood, evoking the quiet luxury of a bespoke tailored coat.</p><p>When you take off the pink and black labels, true luxury is wearing whatever makes you feel unstoppable.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>What you are actually paying for in a £250 bottle</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>In a standard £250 designer unisex perfume, the actual fragrance oil costs under £5. The rest is distributor margin and Mayfair retail rent.</p><p>With Scentspired, you get 20%+ oil concentration formulated in Grasse for around £25.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
